<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1868</h1><p class="ref-lede">1868 in world history: 33 events, 30 births, 18 deaths, 5 works, 10 states founded and 6 that came to an end. 1,014 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
